10-sec Concept (Draft)

0:00–0:03 Husband sitting on the edge of the bed looking worried. Wife notices something is bothering him.

Dialogue: &quot;अगर आपकी टाइमिंग कम है... और जल्दी वीर्य निकल जाता है...&quot;

0:03–0:06 Husband looks embarrassed. Wife comforts him.

Dialogue: &quot;...जिसकी वजह से शर्मिंदगी महसूस होती है...&quot;

0:06–0:10 Wife picks up Vedicurja and looks at him confidently. Product close-up.

Dialogue: &quot;तो आपके लिए है Vedicurja...&quot;

This is the initial 10-second concept based on the reference direction. I&#39;m refining the remaining shots and dialogue while keeping it aligned with your winner script and the last reference.

